        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository eab30219-cd83-43ec-86c8-2be0e3e27119).Image",
        "Description": "It looks like a band of thugs have infiltrated the Milton-Fitzpatrick Bank in New York. This is obviously the work of a larger crime syndicate and initial proposals were to let them operate until we might get a lead on their higher ups. But it was deemed to dangerous for the bank workers and immediate remediation of the problem has been requested. Locate the targets and give no quarter, avoid casualties at all costs. Maybe you can find some clues on their bodies...\r\rBy Celllie",
